  {
   "name": "intella/custom-section",
   "attrs": {
    "label": "Be found when buyers are ready to act",
    "html": "<section class=\"section section--white\" aria-labelledby=\"why-title\">\n\t\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"story\">\n\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"section-title\" id=\"why-title\">Be found when buyers are <span class=\"accent\">ready to act</span></h2>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"story__body\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>When someone searches for what you sell, they already have a need. Ranking for those searches puts you in front of buyers at the exact moment they are choosing who to call.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>Unlike ads, good rankings keep working when you stop spending. Every page that ranks becomes an asset that brings in visitors month after month.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>But traffic on its own doesn’t pay the bills. We focus on the searches that lead to enquiries, and on making sure your pages turn visitors into leads.</p>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<ul class=\"tilt-grid tilt-grid--3 why-points\" role=\"list\">\n\t\t\t\t<li class=\"tilt-card\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-tile\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-search\"/></svg></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"tilt-card__title\">Intent, not just traffic</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"tilt-card__text\">We target the searches people make when they’re ready to buy, not vanity keywords.</p>\n\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li class=\"tilt-card\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-tile\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-layers\"/></svg></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"tilt-card__title\">A site Google can trust</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"tilt-card__text\">Fast, crawlable, well-structured pages give every piece of content a better chance to rank.</p>\n\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li class=\"tilt-card\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-tile\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-trend\"/></svg></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"tilt-card__title\">Growth that compounds</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"tilt-card__text\">Rankings build on each other, so results grow over time instead of stopping when spend stops.</p>\n\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</section>",
    "css": "seo",
    "modules": []
   }
  },
  {
   "name": "intella/custom-section",
   "attrs": {
    "label": "What SEO growth looks like",
    "html": "<section class=\"section section--cream showcase\" aria-labelledby=\"showcase-title\">\n\t\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section-head section-head--center\">\n\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"section-title\" id=\"showcase-title\">What SEO growth <span class=\"accent\">looks like</span></h2>\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"section-lead\">More clicks from Google, more visitors from search, and more of them turning into enquiries. This is the kind of report you get from us every month.</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"showcase__grid\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"showcase__main\"><figure class=\"mock\">\n\t<div class=\"mock__bar\"><span class=\"mock__dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class=\"mock__title\">Search Console · Performance · Last 12 months</span></div>\n\t<div class=\"mock__body\"><div class=\"mock-stats\"><div class=\"mock-stat mock-stat--violet\"><div class=\"mock-stat__label\">Total clicks</div><div class=\"mock-stat__value\">48.2K</div><span class=\"mock-up\">▲ +212%</span></div><div class=\"mock-stat\"><div class=\"mock-stat__label\">Impressions</div><div class=\"mock-stat__value\">1.9M</div><span class=\"mock-up\">▲ +185%</span></div><div class=\"mock-stat\"><div class=\"mock-stat__label\">Average CTR</div><div class=\"mock-stat__value\">2.5%</div><span class=\"mock-up\">▲ +0.6 pts</span></div><div class=\"mock-stat\"><div class=\"mock-stat__label\">Average position</div><div class=\"mock-stat__value\">8.4</div><span class=\"mock-up\">▲ from 21.6</span></div></div><svg class=\"mock-chart\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 210\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Clicks and impressions growing over 12 months\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"g34600\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#8f2cf4\" stop-opacity=\"0.28\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#8f2cf4\" stop-opacity=\"0\"/></linearGradient></defs><line x1=\"16\" x2=\"622\" y1=\"12.0\" y2=\"12.0\" stroke=\"#efeaf2\"/><line x1=\"16\" x2=\"622\" y1=\"55.0\" y2=\"55.0\" stroke=\"#efeaf2\"/><line x1=\"16\" x2=\"622\" y1=\"98.0\" y2=\"98.0\" stroke=\"#efeaf2\"/><line x1=\"16\" x2=\"622\" y1=\"141.0\" y2=\"141.0\" stroke=\"#efeaf2\"/><line x1=\"16\" x2=\"622\" y1=\"184.0\" y2=\"184.0\" stroke=\"#efeaf2\"/><path d=\"M16.0,149.3 L71.1,146.4 L126.2,147.8 L181.3,140.6 L236.4,134.8 L291.5,129.0 L346.5,117.4 L401.6,108.7 L456.7,100.0 L511.8,85.5 L566.9,71.1 L622.0,59.5 L622.0,184 L16.0,184 Z\" fill=\"url(#g34600)\"/><path d=\"M16.0,149.3 L71.1,146.4 L126.2,147.8 L181.3,140.6 L236.4,134.8 L291.5,129.0 L346.5,117.4 L401.6,108.7 L456.7,100.0 L511.8,85.5 L566.9,71.1 L622.0,59.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8f2cf4\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"622.0\" cy=\"59.5\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#8f2cf4\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><path d=\"M16.0,126.1 L71.1,120.3 L126.2,117.4 L181.3,108.7 L236.4,100.0 L291.5,97.1 L346.5,82.7 L401.6,74.0 L456.7,65.3 L511.8,50.8 L566.9,42.1 L622.0,27.6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#c43aa6\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"622.0\" cy=\"27.6\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#c43aa6\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><text x=\"16.0\" y=\"204\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Jan</text><text x=\"126.2\" y=\"204\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Mar</text><text x=\"236.4\" y=\"204\" text-anchor=\"middle\">May</text><text x=\"346.5\" y=\"204\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Jul</text><text x=\"456.7\" y=\"204\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Sep</text><text x=\"566.9\" y=\"204\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Nov</text><text x=\"622.0\" y=\"204\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Dec</text></svg><div class=\"mock-legend\"><span><i style=\"background:#8f2cf4\"></i>Clicks</span><span><i style=\"background:#c43aa6\"></i>Impressions (scaled)</span></div></div>\n</figure></div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"showcase__side\"><figure class=\"mock\">\n\t<div class=\"mock__bar\"><span class=\"mock__dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class=\"mock__title\">GA4 · Organic search</span></div>\n\t<div class=\"mock__body\"><p class=\"mock__heading\">Organic sessions and leads</p><div class=\"mock-stats mock-stats--3\"><div class=\"mock-stat mock-stat--violet\"><div class=\"mock-stat__label\">Sessions</div><div class=\"mock-stat__value\">31.4K</div><span class=\"mock-up\">▲ +168%</span></div><div class=\"mock-stat\"><div class=\"mock-stat__label\">Leads</div><div class=\"mock-stat__value\">412</div><span class=\"mock-up\">▲ +240%</span></div><div class=\"mock-stat\"><div class=\"mock-stat__label\">Conversion rate</div><div class=\"mock-stat__value\">1.3%</div><span class=\"mock-up\">▲ +0.3 pts</span></div></div><svg class=\"mock-chart\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 190\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Monthly organic sessions\"><rect x=\"17.0\" y=\"127.7\" width=\"30.4\" height=\"38.3\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#cbb7e4\"/><text x=\"32.2\" y=\"184\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Jan</text><rect x=\"69.3\" y=\"124.2\" width=\"30.4\" height=\"41.8\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#cbb7e4\"/><rect x=\"121.7\" y=\"120.7\" width=\"30.4\" height=\"45.3\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#cbb7e4\"/><text x=\"136.8\" y=\"184\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Mar</text><rect x=\"174.0\" y=\"113.8\" width=\"30.4\" height=\"52.2\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#cbb7e4\"/><rect x=\"226.3\" y=\"110.3\" width=\"30.4\" height=\"55.7\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#cbb7e4\"/><text x=\"241.5\" y=\"184\" text-anchor=\"middle\">May</text><rect x=\"278.7\" y=\"99.8\" width=\"30.4\" height=\"66.2\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#cbb7e4\"/><rect x=\"331.0\" y=\"89.4\" width=\"30.4\" height=\"76.6\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#cbb7e4\"/><text x=\"346.2\" y=\"184\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Jul</text><rect x=\"383.3\" y=\"78.9\" width=\"30.4\" height=\"87.1\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#cbb7e4\"/><rect x=\"435.7\" y=\"65.0\" width=\"30.4\" height=\"101.0\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#cbb7e4\"/><text x=\"450.8\" y=\"184\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Sep</text><rect x=\"488.0\" y=\"51.1\" width=\"30.4\" height=\"114.9\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#8f2cf4\"/><rect x=\"540.3\" y=\"40.6\" width=\"30.4\" height=\"125.4\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#8f2cf4\"/><text x=\"555.5\" y=\"184\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Nov</text><rect x=\"592.7\" y=\"26.7\" width=\"30.4\" height=\"139.3\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#8f2cf4\"/><text x=\"607.8\" y=\"184\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Dec</text></svg></div>\n</figure></div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<ul class=\"outcomes\" role=\"list\"><li><span class=\"icon-tile\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-trend\"/></svg></span><div><h3 class=\"outcome__title\">More qualified traffic</h3><p>Visitors who searched for what you sell, not random clicks.</p></div></li><li><span class=\"icon-tile\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-target\"/></svg></span><div><h3 class=\"outcome__title\">Higher rankings for money keywords</h3><p>Page 1 positions for the searches that bring enquiries.</p></div></li><li><span class=\"icon-tile\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-chart\"/></svg></span><div><h3 class=\"outcome__title\">Leads you can trace</h3><p>Every enquiry from search tracked in GA4 and your CRM.</p></div></li></ul>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</section>",
    "css": "seo",
    "modules": []
   }
